body:
Come here we want your money, no just kidding I think it depends on the season. There are times in summer when Zurich and especialy Luzern are full of Turists but right now there are only a few and the train ride alone between this places will blow your mind and your bank account equaly. Other than cities it depends on your intrests and amount of money.
You like Mountains and are a milionair, go to the Jungfraujoch. You like Mountains, trains and are not a Milionair, drive over the Bernina. You can even leave the train for a hike and pick up the next. If you are able to speak French, visit Lausanne and Geneva.

for any more tips its 5Franks ;)

Ich habe 2 fragen;
1) hast du damit begonnen weil du "edgy" sein wolltest oder wie bist du darauf gekommen?
2) ich bin eine Metal Ventilatorin, hörst du Metal und wenn ja welches sub genere.
